      "message": "Breaks KMI. Please refactor to avoid changing `struct irq_desc`:\n```\nunction symbol \u0027struct fwnode_handle* __dev_fwnode(struct device*)\u0027 changed\n  CRC changed from 0x5be47850 to 0x8dc5a446\n\nfunction symbol \u0027const struct fwnode_handle* __dev_fwnode_const(const struct device*)\u0027 changed\n  CRC changed from 0x3be18f17 to 0x834eef26\n\nfunction symbol \u0027struct regmap* __devm_regmap_init_i2c(struct i2c_client*, const struct regmap_config*, struct lock_class_key*, const char*)\u0027 changed\n  CRC changed from 0x86d903c9 to 0xbfc62236\n\n... 602 omitted; 605 symbols have only CRC changes\n\ntype \u0027struct irq_desc\u0027 changed\n  member changed from \u0027unsigned int* kstat_irqs\u0027 to \u0027struct irqstat* kstat_irqs\u0027\n    type changed from \u0027unsigned int*\u0027 to \u0027struct irqstat*\u0027\n      pointed-to type changed from \u0027unsigned int\u0027 to \u0027struct irqstat\u0027\n```",
      "fixSuggestions": [
